k into the nearby canal had Sophie Casterwill not intervened. They later helped Ford and Ryder in their attempts to get a treasure. [The School of Mystery]\n\nFord's gang later fought the Huntik team again in Venice, during the siege of devastation left by Grand Dragon Leviathan. [The Curse of Venice][Grand Dragon Leviathan (Comic)]\n\nPersonality\n\nThe members of the gang are nasty bullies who, like most gangs of bullies, mindless follow Ford around.\n\nAbilities\n\nThe gang rely on basic Organization spells and Titans.\n\nSpells Utilized\n\n• Augerfrost\n• Raypulse\n\nBonded Titans\n\n• Mindrone\n• Redcap\n\nGallery","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image = File:Ford's Gang.png\n| relations = [[Ford]] (leader)\n| base = [[Venice Preparation Academy]]\n| group = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}\n| first appearance    = \"[[The School of Mystery]]\"\n| last appearance    = \"[[Grand Dragon Leviathan (Comic)|Grand Dragon Leviathan]]\"\n}}'''Ford's Gang''' is a branch of [[the Organization]] consisting of students from the [[Venice Preparation Academy]]. Their leader is [[Ford]]. \n\n== History ==\n[[Ford]] and his gang bullied [[Lok Lambert]] and would have thrown Lok into the nearby canal had [[Sophie Casterwill]] not intervened. They later helped [[Ford]] and [[Ryder]] in their attempts to get a treasure. {{Source|The School of Mystery}}\n\nFord's gang later fought the Huntik team again in Venice, during the siege of devastation left by [[Grand Dragon Leviathan]]. {{source|The Curse of Venice}}{{source|Grand Dragon Leviathan (Comic)}}\n\n== Personality ==\nThe members of the gang are nasty bullies who, like most gangs of bullies, mindless follow Ford around.\n== Abilities ==\nThe gang rely on basic [[Organization]] spells and [[Titans]].\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}\n===Spells Utilized===\n*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n{{Col-2}}\n===Bonded Titans===\n*[[Mindrone]]\n*[[Redcap]]\n{{Col-end}}\n== Gallery ==\n<gallery captionalign=\"left\">\nFord's Gang 2.png\n<